Lyra CommonUser compatibility fixes for Unreal Engine 5.8.4 (macOS / Apple clang)

Apply from the root of a Lyra project (the directory containing
LyraStarterGame.uproject) with `git apply -p1`. Tools/Lyra/setup_mac.sh does
this safely and repeatably. Changes, and nothing else:

  CommonUserBasicPresence.cpp
    Remove the four `break;` statements that follow a `return` in
    UCommonUserBasicPresence::SessionStateToBackendKey (unreachable code).
  CommonSessionSubsystem.cpp
    UCommonSessionSubsystem::HandleQuickPlaySearchFinished: replace the loop
    that returns on its first iteration with direct access to Results[0]. The
    existing `ResultCount > 0` guard is kept.
    UCommonSessionSubsystem::OnFindSessionsComplete (OSSv1 path): remove
    only the unreachable `if (0)` fake-session test block.

